    "sources_refused": [
      "fuzu.com — HTTP 403 at the host for every path tried. Bot/CDN protection, not robots.txt, which permits listings and publishes a job sitemap. Not worked around.",
      "brightermonday.co.ke — robots.txt Disallow: /job/ and Disallow: /*industry=*. Job pages are off-limits by the site's own rules, so they were never requested.",
      "jobwebkenya.com — robots.txt sets Crawl-delay: 60, which makes any useful volume impractical to collect politely. Not attempted."
    ],
    "known_gaps": "The second pass added trades the first missed -- carpentry, electrical, chef and kitchen work, housekeeping, gardening, driving, coaching. Still absent from every page read: plumbing, masonry, welding, tailoring, hairdressing, barbering and boda/rider work. A formal job board does not advertise them. They come from CURATED in the builder and are labelled curated, not observed. The title directory read covers roughly B-H only; pages 1, 6 and 7 were not fetched.",
    "note": "Terms outside this platform's scope -- clinical practice, aviation, maritime, oil and gas -- were collected here as they appeared and are dropped by OUT_OF_SCOPE in the builder rather than edited out here, so the raw observation stays honest.",
    "source_errata": "Two listing titles were misspelt at source -- 'Socal Media and Content Lead' and 'Cateres II' -- and were normalised to 'Social Media Lead' and 'Cateress'."
